<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Central Bank cuts overnight rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine Central Bank cuts overnight rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Monday it had cut its overnight borrowing rate to 10.25 percent from 10.5 percent.</p>
<p>The bank also cut its overnight lending rate to 12.75 percent from 13.0 percent.</p>
</text>
